  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The validated row covers SingleR mapping between count-backed h5ad objects with exact feature identifiers, reviewed marker JSON, and a declared Cell Ontology graph contract. GSE96583 held-out-donor evidence shows high precision with deliberately conservative, class-dependent coverage; CD8 T and NK cells were frequently retained as Unknown and must not be presented as comprehensively annotated. The module does not download or certify a reference atlas, infer ontology edges, replace expert review, automatically promote unknown cells, resolve continuous transitional states, manage execution infrastructure, or execute CellTypist, Azimuth, popV, or scmap. Post hoc truth is optional and never used for annotation decisions."
  ],
